 "kind": "html",
 "prompt": "Create a single-page Three.js scene of a synthwave neon city made from procedural box buildings. Include animated camera flythrough, emissive windows, atmospheric fog, and a starfield background. Add keyboard controls (WASD + mouse look), and expose fly speed, fog density, and building density in a small on-screen control panel. Output one self-contained HTML file with inline JavaScript.",
 "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"/>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/>\n<title>SYNTHWAVE // Neon City</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;900&family=Rajdhani:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{--pink:#ff2d95;--cyan:#2de2ff}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#05010d;font-family:'Rajdhani',system-ui,sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#vignette{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:5;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,transparent 55%,rgba(5,0,16,.6) 100%)}\n#scan{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:6;opacity:.4;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.14) 0 1px,transparent 1px 3px)}\n#ui{position:fixed;top:16px;left:16px;z-index:10;min-width:256px;padding:16px 18px 13px;border-radius:14px;color:#efeaff;background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(22,6,44,.74),rgba(8,2,20,.74));border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,.35);box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,45,149,.18),inset 0 0 60px rgba(45,226,255,.06);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);user-select:none}\n#ui h1{margin:0 0 3px;font-family:'Orbitron';font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.26em;font-weight:900;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff2d95,#b44dff,#2de2ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255,45,149,.4))}\n#ui .sub{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.38em;color:#8f86c9;margin-bottom:12px;text-transform:uppercase}\n.row{margin:9px 0}\n.row label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c9c2f2;margin-bottom:5px}\n.row label b{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600}\ninput[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff2d95,#2de2ff);outline:none;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #ff2d95;box-shadow:0 0 10px #ff2d95;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #ff2d95;box-shadow:0 0 10px #ff2d95}\n.chk{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:12px 0 4px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c9c2f2;cursor:pointer}\n.chk input{accent-color:#ff2d95;width:15px;height:15px;cursor:pointer}\n.keys{margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(140,120,255,.18);font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:#8f86c9;letter-spacing:.05em}\n.keys kbd{display:inline-block;min-width:15px;padding:0 4px;margin:0 1px;border:1px solid rgba(45,226,255,.4);border-radius:4px;color:var(--cyan);font-size:10px;text-align:center}\n#hint{position:fixed;bottom:18px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:10;padding:9px 20px;border-radius:999px;font-family:'Orbitron';font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.26em;color:#ffb3d9;background:rgba(15,3,30,.55);border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,.3);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);pointer-events:none;text-transform:uppercase;transition:opacity .8s}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"vignette\"></div><div id=\"scan\"></div>\n<div id=\"ui\">\n  <h1>SYNTHWAVE</h1>\n  <div class=\"sub\">neon city flythrough</div>\n  <div class=\"row\"><label>Fly speed <b id=\"vSpeed\">70</b></label><input id=\"pSpeed\" type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"240\" value=\"70\"></div>\n  <div class=\"row\"><label>Fog density <b id=\"vFog\">28</b></label><input id=\"pFog\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"90\" value=\"28\"></div>\n  <div class=\"row\"><label>Buildings <b id=\"vDen\">70%</b></label><input id=\"pDen\" type=\"range\" min=\"15\" max=\"100\" value=\"70\"></div>\n  <div class=\"row\"><label>Glow <b id=\"vGlow\">90</b></label><input id=\"pGlow\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"200\" value=\"90\"></div>\n  <label class=\"chk\"><input id=\"pAuto\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> auto pilot</label>\n  <div class=\"keys\"><kbd>W</kbd><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd> fly &nbsp; <kbd>Space</kbd>/<kbd>Shift</kbd> up/down &nbsp; mouse look</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"hint\">click to take the controls</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/three@0.128.0/examples/js/shaders/CopyShader.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/three@0.128.0/examples/js/shaders/LuminosityHighPassShader.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/three@0.128.0/examples/js/postprocessing/EffectComposer.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/three@0.128.0/examples/js/postprocessing/RenderPass.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/three@0.128.0/examples/js/postprocessing/ShaderPass.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/three@0.128.0/examples/js/postprocessing/UnrealBloomPass.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n\"use strict\";\n\n/* ============================== CORE ============================== */\nvar CELL=46, N=24, C=N*CELL, LOT=CELL-14;\n\nvar renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,powerPreference:'high-performance'});\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio,2));\nrenderer.setSize(window.innerWidth,window.innerHeight);\nrenderer.toneMapping=THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\nrenderer.toneMappingExposure=1.15;\ndocument.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\nvar scene=new THREE.Scene();\nscene.background=new THREE.Color(0x070113);\nscene.fog=new THREE.FogExp2(0x150424,0.0028);\n\nvar camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(72,window.innerWidth/window.innerHeight,0.1,7000);\ncamera.rotation.order='YXZ';\n\nvar P={speed:70,dens:0.7,auto:true};\nvar T=0, yaw=0, pitch=-0.06, lastLook=-10;\n\n/* ============================== HELPERS / TEXTURES ============================== */\nfunction cnv(w,h){var c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=w;c.height=h;return c}\n\nfunction dotTexture(){\n  var c=cnv(64,64),g=c.getContext('2d');\n  var r=g.createRadialGradient(32,32,0,32,32,32);\n  r.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,255,255,1)');r.addColorStop(.4,'rgba(255,255,255,.55)');r.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,255,255,0)');\n  g.fillStyle=r;g.fillRect(0,0,64,64);\n  return new THREE.CanvasTexture(c);\n}\nvar dotTex=dotTexture();\n\nvar PALETTES=[\n  ['#39e6ff','#8ef4ff','#ffd9a0','#39e6ff'],\n  ['#ff4fd8','#ff9ee7','#39e6ff','#ffd9a0'],\n  ['#b44dff','#ff4fd8','#39e6ff','#e6f7ff'],\n  ['#ffd166','#ff9e4f','#39e6ff','#fff3d6'],\n  ['#39ffb0','#9fffe0','#39e6ff','#ff9ee7'],\n  ['#ff5e5e','#ffd9a0','#ff9ee7','#39e6ff'],\n  ['#8ef4ff','#ffffff','#b44dff','#ff4fd8']\n];\nfunction windowTexture(pal,lit){\n  var c=cnv(256,256),g=c.getContext('2d');\n  g.fillStyle='#05060d';g.fillRect(0,0,256,256);\n  var cols=10,rows=12,cw=256/cols,ch=256/rows,x,y,px,py,r,col;\n  for(y=0;y<rows;y++)for(x=0;x<cols;x++){\n    px=x*cw;py=y*ch;r=Math.random();\n    if(r<lit){\n      col=pal[(Math.random()*pal.length)|0];\n      g.globalAlpha=.3;g.fillStyle=col;g.fillRect(px+1,py+1,cw-2,ch-2);\n      g.globalAlpha=.95;g.fillRect(px+4,py+4,cw-8,ch-8);\n      g.globalAlpha=1;\n      if(Math.random()<.3){g.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.45)';g.fillRect(px+4,py+4,cw-8,(ch-8)/2)}\n    }else if(r<lit+.22){\n      g.fillStyle='#0d1226';g.fillRect(px+4,py+4,cw-8,ch-8);\n    }\n  }\n  g.fillStyle='#05060d';g.fillRect(226,226,30,30); /* guaranteed-dark roof patch */\n  var t=new THREE.CanvasTexture(c);\n  t.wrapS=t.wrapT=THREE.RepeatWrapping;\n  return t;\n}\nvar mats=PALETTES.map(function(p,i){return new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:windowTexture(p,.32+(i%3)*.07)})});\n\nvar stripGeo=new THREE.BoxGeometry(.55,1,.55);\nvar antGeo=new THREE.BoxGeometry(.7,10,.7);\nvar beaGeo=new THREE.SphereGeometry(.95,8,8);\nvar beaconMatA=new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0xff3355});\nvar beaconMatB=new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0xff8833});\nvar antennaMat=new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0x0a0a18});\nvar stripPalette=[0xff2d95,0x2de2ff,0xb44dff,0x39ffb0].map(function(c){return new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:c})});\n\nvar TW=30; /* world units per texture tile */\nfunction buildingGeo(w,h,d){\n  var g=new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),uv=g.attributes.uv;\n  var dims=[[d,h],[d,h],[w,d],[w,d],[w,h],[w,h]];\n  var ox=(Math.random()*6|0),oy=(Math.random()*6|0),f,v,i;\n  for(f=0;f<6;f++)for(v=0;v<4;v++){\n    i=f*4+v;\n    if(f===2||f===3){uv.setXY(i,.945,.945);continue}\n    uv.setXY(i,uv.getX(i)*dims[f][0]/TW+ox,uv.getY(i)*dims[f][1]/TW+oy);\n  }\n  return g;\n}\n\n/* ============================== CITY ============================== */\nvar city=null;\nfunction pickLane(){return ((Math.random()*(N+1))|0)*CELL-C/2}\nfunction nearestLane(x){return Math.max(-C/2,Math.min(C/2,Math.round((x+C/2)/CELL)*CELL-C/2))}\n\nfunction buildCity(dens){\n  if(city){scene.remove(city);city.traverse(function(o){if(o.geometry)o.geometry.dispose()})}\n  city=new THREE.Group();\n  var i,j,cx,cz,distC,h,w,d,ox,oz,m,s,ns,st,side,hh,sx,sz;\n  for(i=0;i<N;i++)for(j=0;j<N;j++){\n    if(Math.random()>dens)continue;\n    cx=(i+.5)*CELL-C/2;cz=(j+.5)*CELL-C/2;\n    distC=Math.hypot(cx,cz)/(C*.5);\n    h=(8+Math.pow(Math.random(),2.2)*70)*(1+Math.max(0,1-distC)*1.5);\n    if(Math.random()<.045)h*=1.9+Math.random()*.8;\n    h=Math.min(h,230);\n    w=LOT*(.55+Math.random()*.4);d=LOT*(.55+Math.random()*.4);\n    ox=(Math.random()-.5)*(LOT-w);oz=(Math.random()-.5)*(LOT-d);\n    m=new THREE.Mesh(buildingGeo(w,h,d),mats[(Math.random()*mats.length)|0]);\n    m.position.set(cx+ox,h/2,cz+oz);\n    city.add(m);\n    if(Math.random()<.3){\n      ns=1+((Math.random()*2)|0);\n      for(s=0;s<ns;s++){\n        st=new THREE.Mesh(stripGeo,stripPalette[(Math.random()*4)|0]);\n        side=(Math.random()*4)|0;sx=cx+ox;sz=cz+oz;\n        if(side===0){sx+=w/2+.35;sz+=(Math.random()-.5)*d*.8}\n        else if(side===1){sx-=w/2+.35;sz+=(Math.random()-.5)*d*.8}\n        else if(side===2){sz+=d/2+.35;sx+=(Math.random()-.5)*w*.8}\n        else{sz-=d/2+.35;sx+=(Math.random()-.5)*w*.8}\n        hh=h*(.5+Math.random()*.5);\n        st.scale.set(1,hh,1);st.position.set(sx,hh/2,sz);\n        city.add(st);\n      }\n    }\n    if(h>110){\n      var a=new THREE.Mesh(antGeo,antennaMat);\n      a.position.set(m.position.x,h+5,m.position.z);\n      var b=new THREE.Mesh(beaGeo,Math.random()<.5?beaconMatA:beaconMatB);\n      b.position.set(m.position.x,h+10.4,m.position.z);\n      city.add(a);city.add(b);\n    }\n  }\n  scene.add(city);\n}\nbuildCity(P.dens);\n\n/* ============================== GROUND GRID ============================== */\nvar groundMat=new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n  uniforms:{uTime:{value:0},uFog:{value:new THREE.Color(0x150424)},uDens:{value:0.0028}},\n  vertexShader:'varying vec3 vW;void main(){vec4 w=modelMatrix*vec4(position,1.0);vW=w.xyz;gl_Position=projectionMatrix*viewMatrix*w;}',\n  fragmentShader:[\n    'varying vec3 vW;uniform float uTime;uniform vec3 uFog;uniform float uDens;',\n    'void main(){',\n    ' vec2 p=(vW.xz+'+(C/2).toFixed(1)+')/'+CELL.toFixed(1)+';',\n    ' vec2 g=abs(fract(p-0.5)-0.5)/fwidth(p);',\n    ' float line=1.0-min(min(g.x,g.y),1.0);line=pow(line,1.6);',\n    ' float dist=length(vW-cameraPosition);',\n    ' vec3 lineCol=mix(vec3(1.0,0.18,0.55),vec3(0.15,0.85,1.0),clamp(dist/900.0,0.0,1.0)*0.65);',\n    ' float pulse=0.7+0.3*sin(dist*0.045-uTime*3.2);',\n    ' vec3 col=vec3(0.012,0.004,0.03)+lineCol*line*(0.5+0.5*pulse);',\n    ' float fogF=exp(-uDens*uDens*dist*dist);',\n    ' col=mix(uFog,col,clamp(fogF,0.0,1.0));',\n    ' gl_FragColor=vec4(col,1.0);}'\n  ].join('\\n')\n});\ngroundMat.extensions={derivatives:true};\nvar ground=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(7000,7000),groundMat);\nground.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;scene.add(ground);\n\n/* ============================== SUN & HORIZON ============================== */\nfunction sunTexture(){\n  var c=cnv(512,512),g=c.getContext('2d');\n  var grad=g.createLinearGradient(0,40,0,470);\n  grad.addColorStop(0,'#fff3a0');grad.addColorStop(.35,'#ffc14f');grad.addColorStop(.6,'#ff7e3f');grad.addColorStop(.8,'#ff3d7f');grad.addColorStop(1,'#ff2d95');\n  g.fillStyle=grad;g.beginPath();g.arc(256,256,225,0,Math.PI*2);g.fill();\n  g.globalCompositeOperation='destination-out';\n  var y=272,h=3;\n  while(y<512){g.fillRect(0,y,512,h);y+=h+15;h+=2.4}\n  return new THREE.CanvasTexture(c);\n}\nvar sun=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(820,820),\n  new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:sunTexture(),transparent:true,fog:false,depthWrite:false}));\nsun.position.set(0,190,-2600);scene.add(sun);\n\nvar glowC=cnv(256,256),gg=glowC.getContext('2d');\nvar grd=gg.createRadialGradient(128,128,0,128,128,128);\ngrd.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,60,160,.6)');grd.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,60,160,0)');\ngg.fillStyle=grd;gg.fillRect(0,0,256,256);\nvar glow=new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:new THREE.CanvasTexture(glowC),blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,depthWrite:false,fog:false,transparent:true,opacity:.85}));\nglow.scale.set(2400,2400,1);glow.position.set(0,160,-2650);scene.add(glow);\n\nvar bandC=cnv(64,256),bg2=bandC.getContext('2d');\nvar bgGrad=bg2.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,256);\nbgGrad.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,45,149,0)');bgGrad.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,45,149,.4)');\nbg2.fillStyle=bgGrad;bg2.fillRect(0,0,64,256);\nvar band=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(7000,500),\n  new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:new THREE.CanvasTexture(bandC),transparent:true,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,depthWrite:false,fog:false}));\nband.position.set(0,150,-2680);scene.add(band);\n\n/* ============================== STARS ============================== */\nvar SN=1800,sp=new Float32Array(SN*3),sc=new Float32Array(SN*3),i3,th,ph,R=2800,br;\nfor(var si=0;si<SN;si++){\n  i3=si*3;th=Math.random()*Math.PI*2;ph=Math.random()*Math.PI*.52;\n  sp[i3]=R*Math.sin(ph)*Math.cos(th);sp[i3+1]=R*Math.cos(ph)+30;sp[i3+2]=R*Math.sin(ph)*Math.sin(th);\n  br=.35+Math.random()*.65;\n  var rr=Math.random(),cr=br,cg=br,cb=br;\n  if(rr<.15){cr=br*.6;cb=br}else if(rr<.3){cg=br*.6;cr=br}\n  sc[i3]=cr;sc[i3+1]=cg;sc[i3+2]=cb;\n}\nvar starGeo=new THREE.BufferGeometry();\nstarGeo.setAttribute('position',new THREE.BufferAttribute(sp,3));\nstarGeo.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(sc,3));\nvar starMat=new THREE.PointsMaterial({size:2.2,map:dotTex,sizeAttenuation:false,vertexColors:true,transparent:true,depthWrite:false,fog:false,opacity:.9,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending});\nscene.add(new THREE.Points(starGeo,starMat));\n\n/* ============================== TRAFFIC ============================== */\nvar CAR_N=240,carPos=new Float32Array(CAR_N*3),carCol=new Float32Array(CAR_N*3),cars=[];\nfor(var ci=0;ci<CAR_N;ci++){\n  var dir=Math.random()<.5?1:-1;\n  cars.push({axis:Math.random()<.5?'x':'z',lane:pickLane()+(Math.random()<.5?-3:3),dir:dir,t:(Math.random()-.5)*(C+200),v:18+Math.random()*22});\n  var cc=dir>0?[.75,.95,1]:[1,.16,.34];\n  carCol[ci*3]=cc[0];carCol[ci*3+1]=cc[1];carCol[ci*3+2]=cc[2];\n}\nvar carGeo=new THREE.BufferGeometry();\ncarGeo.setAttribute('position',new THREE.BufferAttribute(carPos,3));\ncarGeo.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(carCol,3));\nscene.add(new THREE.Points(carGeo,new THREE.PointsMaterial({size:2.6,map:dotTex,vertexColors:true,transparent:true,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,depthWrite:false,sizeAttenuation:true})));\nfunction updateCars(dt){\n  for(var i=0;i<CAR_N;i++){var c=cars[i];\n    c.t+=c.v*c.dir*dt;\n    if(c.t>C/2+120)c.t=-C/2-120;if(c.t<-C/2-120)c.t=C/2+120;\n    if(c.axis==='x'){carPos[i*3]=c.t;carPos[i*3+2]=c.lane}\n    else{carPos[i*3]=c.lane;carPos[i*3+2]=c.t}\n    carPos[i*3+1]=1.5;\n  }\n  carGeo.attributes.position.needsUpdate=true;\n}\nupdateCars(0);\n\n/* ============================== POST ============================== */\nvar composer=null,bloom=null;\nif(THREE.EffectComposer&&THREE.RenderPass&&THREE.UnrealBloomPass){\n  composer=new THREE.EffectComposer(renderer);\n  composer.addPass(new THREE.RenderPass(scene,camera));\n  bloom=new THREE.UnrealBloomPass(new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth,window.innerHeight),.9,.65,.12);\n  composer.addPass(bloom);\n}\n\n/* ============================== CONTROLS ============================== */\nvar keys={},vel=new THREE.Vector3(),dragging=false,px=0,py=0;\nvar cv=renderer.domElement;\nfunction setAuto(v){\n  P.auto=v;document.getElementById('pAuto').checked=v;\n  if(v){auto.z=camera.position.z;auto.lane=nearestLane(camera.position.x)}\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n  if(e.target.tagName==='INPUT')return;\n  keys[e.code]=true;\n  if(e.code==='Space')e.preventDefault();\n  if(['KeyW','KeyA','KeyS','KeyD','Space','ShiftLeft','ShiftRight','KeyQ','KeyE'].indexOf(e.code)>-1)setAuto(false);\n});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup',function(e){keys[e.code]=false});\n\ncv.addEventListener('click',function(){\n  document.getElementById('hint').style.opacity=0;\n  if(cv.requestPointerLock)cv.requestPointerLock();\n});\ncv.addEventListener('mousedown',function(e){dragging=true;px=e.clientX;py=e.clientY});\nwindow.addEventListener('mouseup',function(){dragging=false});\nwindow.addEventListener('mousemove',function(e){\n  if(document.pointerLockElement===cv)look(e.movementX,e.movementY);\n  else if(dragging){look(e.clientX-px,e.clientY-py);px=e.clientX;py=e.clientY}\n});\nvar lastTX=null,lastTY=null;\ncv.addEventListener('touchstart',function(e){var t=e.touches[0];lastTX=t.clientX;lastTY=t.clientY;document.getElementById('hint').style.opacity=0},{passive:true});\ncv.addEventListener('touchmove',function(e){\n  var t=e.touches[0];look((t.clientX-lastTX)*2,(t.clientY-lastTY)*2);lastTX=t.clientX;lastTY=t.clientY;e.preventDefault();\n},{passive:false});\nfunction look(dx,dy){\n  yaw-=dx*.0022;pitch-=dy*.0022;\n  pitch=Math.max(-1.45,Math.min(1.45,pitch));\n  lastLook=T;\n  camera.rotation.y=yaw;camera.rotation.x=pitch;\n}\nfunction lerpAngle(a,b,t){var d=((b-a+Math.PI*3)%(Math.PI*2))-Math.PI;return a+d*t}\n\nvar auto={lane:pickLane(),z:C*0.45};\ncamera.position.set(auto.lane,26,auto.z);\ncamera.rotation.y=yaw;camera.rotation.x=pitch;\n\n/* ============================== UI ============================== */\nfunction bind(id,fn){var el=document.getElementById(id);el.addEventListener('input',function(){fn(el.value);el.blur()});return el}\nbind('pSpeed',function(v){P.speed=+v;document.getElementById('vSpeed').textContent=v});\nbind('pFog',function(v){scene.fog.density=+v/10000;document.getElementById('vFog').textContent=v});\nvar denTimer=null;\nbind('pDen',function(v){\n  document.getElementById('vDen').textContent=v+'%';\n  clearTimeout(denTimer);denTimer=setTimeout(function(){buildCity(+v/100)},180);\n});\nbind('pGlow',function(v){if(bloom)bloom.strength=+v/100;document.getElementById('vGlow').textContent=v});\ndocument.getElementById('pAuto').addEventListener('change',function(){setAuto(this.checked);this.blur()});\n\nwindow.addEventListener('resize',function(){\n  camera.aspect=window.innerWidth/window.innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n  renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth,window.innerHeight);\n  if(composer)composer.setSize(window.innerWidth,window.innerHeight);\n});\n\n/* ============================== LOOP ============================== */\nvar clock=new THREE.Clock();\nvar fwd=new THREE.Vector3(),rgt=new THREE.Vector3(),up=new THREE.Vector3(0,1,0),desired=new THREE.Vector3();\nfunction tick(){\n  requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  var dt=Math.min(clock.getDelta(),.05);T+=dt;\n\n  if(P.auto){\n    auto.z-=P.speed*1.15*dt;\n    if(auto.z<-C/2-80){auto.z=C/2+80;auto.lane=pickLane()}\n    var tx=auto.lane+Math.sin(T*.4)*4.5;\n    camera.position.x+=(tx-camera.position.x)*Math.min(1,dt*1.6);\n    camera.position.z=auto.z;\n    var ty=25+Math.sin(T*.55)*6+Math.sin(T*1.7)*1.2;\n    camera.position.y+=(ty-camera.position.y)*Math.min(1,dt*1.4);\n    if(T-lastLook>2.2){\n      yaw=lerpAngle(yaw,0,Math.min(1,dt*1.3));\n      pitch+=(-0.06-pitch)*Math.min(1,dt*1.2);\n      camera.rotation.y=yaw;camera.rotation.x=pitch;\n    }\n    camera.rotation.z=Math.sin(T*.5)*.018;\n    vel.multiplyScalar(Math.exp(-dt*8));\n  }else{\n    camera.rotation.z=0;\n    camera.getWorldDirection(fwd);\n    rgt.crossVectors(fwd,up).normalize();\n    var mz=(keys.KeyW?1:0)-(keys.KeyS?1:0);\n    var mx=(keys.KeyD?1:0)-(keys.KeyA?1:0);\n    var my=(keys.Space||keys.KeyE?1:0)-(keys.ShiftLeft||keys.ShiftRight||keys.KeyQ?1:0);\n    desired.set(0,0,0).addScaledVector(fwd,mz).addScaledVector(rgt,mx).addScaledVector(up,my);\n    if(desired.lengthSq()>1)desired.normalize();\n    desired.multiplyScalar(P.speed);\n    vel.lerp(desired,1-Math.exp(-dt*6));\n    camera.position.addScaledVector(vel,dt);\n    camera.position.y=Math.max(2.5,Math.min(500,camera.position.y));\n  }\n\n  updateCars(dt);\n  var b1=(Math.sin(T*3.2)>0)?1:.1,b2=(Math.sin(T*3.2+Math.PI)>0)?1:.1;\n  beaconMatA.color.setRGB(b1,.2*b1,.33*b1);\n  beaconMatB.color.setRGB(b2,.45*b2,.15*b2);\n  starMat.opacity=.72+.28*Math.sin(T*1.3);\n\n  groundMat.uniforms.uTime.value=T;\n  groundMat.uniforms.uDens.value=scene.fog.density;\n  groundMat.uniforms.uFog.value.copy(scene.fog.color);\n\n  if(composer)composer.render();else renderer.render(scene,camera);\n}\ntick();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
